{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714410/extras/da980ede58faf5b9ad00822bef6dd8c6.avif?t=1750057558\" width=800 height=374 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Story Background:\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>In a magical and wondrous Otherworld, a terrifying black dust once fell from the sky, inflicting severe illnesses and leaving countless villages and towns desolate.<br>You awaken in the Merlin Mountains with no memory. To uncover the truth, you must explore diverse lands. The journey is perilous, but allies will join your quest.<br>A looming crisis forces you and your companions to embark on a perilous journey to save this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bCore Gameplay:\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Story-driven exploration across vast maps</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Real-time 2D combat system</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>NPC affinity system and party recruitment</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Randomized skills and item drops</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>New Game+ mode (multiple playthroughs)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bPlaytime:\u200b</strong>\u200b 5+ hours<br>\u200b<strong>\u200bArt Style:\u200b</strong>\u200b <i>Pixel/Hand-drawn hybrid</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bKey Features:\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore 10 unique zones, unlock 50+ skills, and battle colossal bosses.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Minimalist controls with environmental hazards (e.g., fall damage from heights).</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collect magical tools: wings for flight, magnifiers to analyze enemies, telescopes for scenic views, grappling hooks for climbing, and more.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bFuture Updates:\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Expand the story with new modes (Arena battles, pet capture mechanics).</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Add new maps: Luo River &amp; Abyssal Trench, Insectoid Battlefield, and Shadow Realm.</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714410?t=1750057558","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714410?t=1750057558","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714410/b4ce8bc844e722daa6101cbd6b721cbc5dbb4567/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750057558","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714410/b4ce8bc844e722daa6101cbd6b721cbc5dbb4567/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750057558","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714410/extras/da980ede58faf5b9ad00822bef6dd8c6.avif?t=1750057558\" width=800 height=374 /></span><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Story Background:\u200b</strong>\u200b<br>In a magical and wondrous Otherworld, a terrifying black dust once fell from the sky, inflicting severe illnesses and leaving countless villages and towns desolate.<br>You awaken in the Merlin Mountains with no memory. To uncover the truth, you must explore diverse lands. The journey is perilous, but allies will join your quest.<br>A looming crisis forces you and your companions to embark on a perilous journey to save this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bCore Gameplay:\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Story-driven exploration across vast maps</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Real-time 2D combat system</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>NPC affinity system and party recruitment</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Randomized skills and item drops</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>New Game+ mode (multiple playthroughs)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bPlaytime:\u200b</strong>\u200b 5+ hours<br>\u200b<strong>\u200bArt Style:\u200b</strong>\u200b <i>Pixel/Hand-drawn hybrid</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bKey Features:\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore 10 unique zones, unlock 50+ skills, and battle colossal bosses.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Minimalist controls with environmental hazards (e.g., fall damage from heights).</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collect magical tools: wings for flight, magnifiers to analyze enemies, telescopes for scenic views, grappling hooks for climbing, and more.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bFuture Updates:\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Expand the story with new modes (Arena battles, pet capture mechanics).</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Add new maps: Luo River &amp; Abyssal Trench, Insectoid Battlefield, and Shadow Realm.</i></p></li></ul>","developers":["\u9759\u591c\u4e4b\u672b\u5f71\u4f20\u8bf4"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"head